		line-height: 1.6;
		color: rgba(41, 41, 41, 0.78);
	}
	.keeper-keys { display: none; }
	@media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) { .keeper-keys { display: list-item; } }
	.keeper-name {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 6px;
		width: min(260px, 100%);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: rgba(41, 41, 41, 0.7);
	}
	.keeper-name input {
		padding: 11px 12px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(41, 41, 41, 0.25);
		border-radius: 6px;
